<km-doc>
<km-title nodeId="ae87637aa0ad4825905fea639f3c2272">说明：排查探针</km-title>
<km-catalog style="none" nodeId="f726d29550be4ff1b5f941cdfb0085a7" />
<h1 nodeId="25d1a16706b64920aea5f87b5688e4fa">一、背景&amp;解决问题</h1>
<p nodeId="fc9ed472b33143f9bb9f0bbbfa9a8bee"><span color=" ">用户对配置的规则、因子（普通、累计）命中不符合预期无法快速定位问题，例如，规则为什么</span><span color="rgb(255, 77, 79)"><strong>命中</strong></span><span color=" ">，为什么</span><span color="rgb(255, 77, 79)"><strong>未命中</strong></span><span color=" ">等原因</span></p>
<p nodeId="b881ab5cf6384078b957f7b26606e625"><span color=" ">排查探针，是通过规则执行的日志，将规则执行流程进行回放并提供给用户，可快速定位问题</span></p>
<h3 nodeId="b6cdfd4c22c14b7b95f3995e22cdca08">流程概述</h3>
<km-drawio src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/251012364/251081326?contentType=0&amp;isNewContent=true" width="1016" height="146" nodeId="bc082376cad24739b7ee76e9d5229d96" />
<p nodeId="81d138d758ef48ad80f62a2ffd0471a9" />
