<p nodeId="ed0436fd007045be87328199b23e994d"><span font-size="14">点击日志查询结果中，生效规则和标记规则命中名称前的放大镜图标</span><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/251012364/251046759?contentType=1" name="image.png" width="32" height="26" nodeId="9de006e7ae68424bbf3f1e8eaa43de7e" /></p>
<p nodeId="eef78de691bc4804b45af01a5645b9fe" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[1270]" nodeId="3e2c1f5cd9414248828359604027d6bb">
<p nodeId="b1790dce8a314604ab8a179d20ec396a"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/251012364/251046385?contentType=1" name="image.png" width="419" height="183" nodeId="777623c991d34e4295fc8bc0e557aa48" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="8afbc03185444d038c3b77c06d0a60d3">
<td colwidth="[339]" nodeId="a685546a87cc4405a2869477951b44f7">
<p nodeId="131ebfe862774d86985f30ca7cfc11f3"><span font-size="14"><strong>【未命中规则】</strong></span></p>
<p nodeId="013ade9bb58e4148a082e7f2aff9d3b8"><span font-size="14">1.在日志进入排查探针查询页面</span></p>
<p nodeId="19161af89a6646e7ae9e870e83fce57d"><span font-size="14">2.展示查询的规则和执行的场景</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[1270]" nodeId="b1a13e3978794032a436e818be0a73d2">
<p nodeId="bdf1948d7bad4546a09c2bb4225a108e"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/251012364/339239281?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="1589961050005-image.png" width="406" height="319" nodeId="baf0f2f62e9d4336bcdbab5356876cbf" /></p>
<p nodeId="a5aca7b71687415ba013bb283bdbd7fe"><span font-size="14">复制日志查询页面的requestId，进入排查探针查询页面</span></p>
<p nodeId="305d54163f4b4b48bbec879986e948ec"><span font-size="14"><strong>查询入口：</strong></span></p>
<p nodeId="d86414406cc14d4dbaf49c68f3fdba03"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/251012364/339222660?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="243" height="369" nodeId="8f38bf843f5240abac6c27ebc75dfef5" /></p>
<p nodeId="434b550ffbb8419fbe59c4998ee7692b"><span font-size="14">输入【</span><span font-size="14"><strong>requestId】</strong></span><span font-size="14">，【</span><span font-size="14"><strong>规则id】</strong></span><span font-size="14">【</span><span font-size="14"><strong>场景id】</strong></span><span font-size="14">，【</span><span font-size="14"><strong>规则在场景中的状态】，得到查询结果</strong></span></p>
<p nodeId="d0649e292cb44c70b2fb24975f2bf7a1"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/251012364/339142981?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="461" height="232" nodeId="1919af10e22b4969a38f54c3b75dc7a1" /></p>
<p nodeId="7a2400011fd546039184ac8cd5e5f463" />
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="39fc0b4da9b548ba89f6591da409e3ab">
<td colwidth="[339]" nodeId="663e0926ed8c4e5b8886cd306f9ed180">
<p nodeId="f6a953b4952d4f5682991cf84dbf55fc"><span font-size="14">【查询命中/未命中规则对应的的因子】</span></p>
<p nodeId="d576805c21ea488c96f17c01217cb35e"><span font-size="14">在规则结果页面，点击待查询因子的右下角，选择逻辑回放</span><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/251012364/339167365?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="310" height="124" nodeId="a97767523c4545b3b7357605c3962996" /></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[1270]" nodeId="37093aedde164c24a3b8a08999a46f25">
<p nodeId="1adea3801d854f5c96da1d86faab09f5"><span font-size="14">规则执行结果页面</span></p>
<p nodeId="85a882bb7b63402ab754cec040b29813"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/251012364/339274097?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="481" height="234" nodeId="e637c3cd9be74ee592087fdb12d5a4af" /></p>
<p nodeId="813386cfb43347e8b33ded16490715c5"><span font-size="14">因子执行结果页面</span></p>
