<tr nodeId="9e73d221d64b46da8bd5fd9c5d0658cd">
<td colwidth="[337]" nodeId="0cea4f0766c942cea1fd497da8e6a9f0">
<p nodeId="7a29a835f7b24f4f9f0fccb85dcc4c82"><span font-size="14">展示规则执行的每一个段逻辑和逻辑的结果</span></p>
<p nodeId="81eb8789a77b472daa2481e0ca227e76"><span color="rgb(0, 0, 0)"><span font-size="14"><strong>是否修改过逻辑：</strong></span></span><span color="rgb(0, 0, 0)"><span font-size="14">规则执行~查询时这段时间规则是否有过变化</span></span></p>
<p nodeId="dc5e350358844f209b0c5c57ff28c8c8"><span font-size="14"><strong>起始节点</strong></span><span font-size="14">：</span></p>
<p nodeId="bbce90e267b646ec82ff431f95c108cb"><span font-size="14"><strong>子节点</strong></span><span font-size="14">：规则中的单层表达式、因子和参数</span></p>
<p nodeId="b3f28d2e8cf94ffba7a624dfc06db61b"><span font-size="14">边：节点与节点间的连线，表明两节点的关联关系</span></p>
<p nodeId="4bee3839a6b646d1b21afc85c3d53224"><span font-size="14">map图颜色</span></p>
<p nodeId="4420ddee75524b22a6972b5141bb0d94"><km-status pattern="outline" color="#ccc" nodeId="b0cbb666dacc449880d6db1f8f1de7df"><span font-size="14">​</span></km-status><span font-size="14">表达式，</span><km-status pattern="outline" color="#ffbb96" nodeId="a3696f88b2414154ae15460a9b205bc8" expand="true"><span font-size="14">​</span></km-status><span font-size="14">规则</span></p>
<p nodeId="cb906552a41b43b2bc90aaad8b5493f8"><km-status pattern="outline" color="#08979c" nodeId="ab7a31cfc68b4d199b50fa1f13d06a12" expand="true"><span font-size="14">​</span></km-status><span font-size="14">因子，</span><km-status pattern="outline" color="#1890ff" nodeId="ea7d76ad9c0045fc8f5d2a75800e0bf7"><span font-size="14">​</span></km-status><span font-size="14">参数</span></p>
<p nodeId="d13f056d1d8f42c2bd71bba453394006"><km-status pattern="outline" color="#f5222d" nodeId="21064382b0ce45f29777c3d0ec7b85ad"><span font-size="14">​</span></km-status><span font-size="14">导致规则命中的核心路径</span></p>
<p nodeId="058e8ffda0b645fd9daeff95c4de8b04"><km-status pattern="fill" color="#ccc" nodeId="931f6952d79d467a923837b9e0e07717"><span font-size="14">​</span></km-status><span font-size="14">未执行的表达式</span></p>
<p nodeId="73c63d01c33f4d298135fca67dc11b54"><span font-size="14">其他：已执行但未命中的逻辑</span></p>
<p nodeId="7ba7428c64ae44b19836458f9dca2195"><span font-size="14">【标签的说明】见特殊说明部分</span></p>
<p nodeId="2aaf8995c02d4ef4aea925beaf54ac21"><span font-size="14">【反馈查询结论】</span></p>
<p nodeId="84f372368af94b16a6878aecf4b38f11"><span font-size="14">本次查询后改规则的命中是符合预期还是不符合预期，如实填写即可</span></p>
<p nodeId="e2d81030c33b4c79836850ebee1a6184"><span font-size="14">用于功能对不符合预期查询的结果统计</span></p>
<p nodeId="1ed45f6d9eb040fa8df158bb9b076fff" />
