<h3 nodeId="190f86072ee9480c9a06633fac7f0f66">异常标签说明</h3>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="8fc040a7bbbf49b88c7a638193d60114">
<tr nodeId="a47134081d46480eabcffa38af115655">
<th colwidth="[142]" nodeId="627b661cf51c4e678628b32415831723">
<p nodeId="b66a4ee31a1f4ae2af019c9e527a5fc7"><span font-size="14">标签</span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[590]" nodeId="28da4c9bb7bf4cf0abcbb664dbbd44d8">
<p nodeId="ce436079fc05411ca58d8207d4493935"><span font-size="14">含义</span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[466]" nodeId="f0e45959c09a4e6097587bce3ddabfc4">
<p nodeId="67a57b42752347e1b737b3cf11600084"><span font-size="14">后续处理建议</span></p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="b5a6d9cd43794c729129983c68fcde87">
<td colwidth="[142]" nodeId="7a2700a9d2e340f8a4bb3cb06974d953">
<p nodeId="0171929d0c0442a2b2d86ff9c1ed5f54"><km-status pattern="fill" color="#ffe58f" nodeId="e8001ed0a34f41d5881d088a21de1852" expand="true"><span font-size="14">​</span><span color="rgb(250, 140, 23)"><span font-size="14">必传参数为空</span></span></km-status></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[590]" nodeId="6c38de4f3ff843379801ef645bc07984">
<p nodeId="c8061c4b2c644d5e9b092759fddc9bc6"><span font-size="14">日志的本条请求中，有因为必须业务提供的参数，业务没传或者传空值导致规则命中</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[466]" nodeId="34e88d7d78e6497b95dce1018d80a480">
<p nodeId="20d8eaf576fb4ca2837806e81fc65155"><span font-size="14">同上游RD沟通，让其提供参数；或修改策略使用其他参数</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="30bfafa284b74cd3bc9ac99b6b83248c">
<td colwidth="[142]" nodeId="c8b2519e7e6e4d3a8fdc76fabce02263">
<p nodeId="92bbb496e78f48e5a9e59067997fe3b5"><km-status pattern="fill" color="#ffe58f" nodeId="e9b82d4b2ea3408c880bd1656f13be0c" expand="true"><span font-size="14">​</span><span color="rgb(250, 140, 23)"><span font-size="14">参数未传</span></span></km-status></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[590]" nodeId="7fc649e8df424d1eb4f65f6e9183ff93">
<p nodeId="764e344a54fb4067a13502da6650b670"><span font-size="14">日志的本条请求中，参数有空值</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[466]" nodeId="f7b06ce4f45b49588ca35e0bc77425f4">
<p nodeId="c9b32cf979d84f12a794eef8a6ca96dc"><span font-size="14">同上游RD沟通，让其提供参数；或修改策略使用其他参数</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="28d2a014090a4b8b9b3c4c5f1486520a">
<td colwidth="[142]" nodeId="eb3d6993521b43f5badf854c1143844c">
<p nodeId="1b0de3cd534b4599a1efda0cd0782453"><km-status pattern="fill" color="#ffe58f" nodeId="9faa5c51090846dbbffecb23d30f913b" expand="true"><span font-size="14">​</span><span color="rgb(250, 140, 23)"><span font-size="14">超时</span></span></km-status></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[590]" nodeId="ad976114522041549f93a1c557637010">
<p nodeId="bff0ef454cca44088a07d64e2105de20"><span font-size="14">日志的本条请求中，需要调用外部接口，但接口超时导致参数为空值</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[466]" nodeId="31c071769d244189b6089594c604a74b">
<p nodeId="854f5d1796c24512869e4ddf1a972988"><span font-size="14">同下游RD沟通，让其提升接口性能；或修改策略使用其他数据</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="f0222241b37449e3b70dd9a7c19db743">
<td colwidth="[142]" nodeId="d109b278babc4480a81737bbfe7643fd">
<p nodeId="dc19b21b990b433d83776a7d7f11fe25"><km-status pattern="fill" color="#ffe58f" nodeId="f698dc0df39d46598bc22a078274f3c1" expand="true"><span font-size="14">​</span><span color="rgb(250, 140, 23)"><span font-size="14">读条件不满足</span></span></km-status><span font-size="14"> </span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[590]" nodeId="17efe13afbd44f6fb480d30b95c064b8">
<p nodeId="f31e4253db354fc29ed1518fc596a52e"><span font-size="14">累计因子/外部接口的读取条件不满足，未读取响应的数值</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[466]" nodeId="19a5b0ef8f284860a10a91346ad1868b">
<p nodeId="93fc8ac9aaec497da50cd60866329b6e"><span font-size="14">确认是否符合预期；或者修改读取条件</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="d99adc9736df42f09eebf18ce08f077c">
<td colwidth="[142]" nodeId="8c7cb6995eda4654b5e106573cb45a9c">
<p nodeId="96982fe4a8a644ca863676116621c569"><km-status pattern="fill" color="#ffe58f" nodeId="508ecb1c7d234f949a477dfc7963c4d0" expand="true"><span font-size="14">​</span><span color="rgb(250, 140, 23)"><span font-size="14">未发送累计</span></span></km-status><span font-size="14"> </span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[590]" nodeId="23a7504ab6b843e7a9ca9940c976bb38">
<p nodeId="f99744596be449d08c3a8d46bb5b3a79"><span font-size="14">累计因子值恒为0或1，产生的原因是近4天内没有发送累计</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[466]" nodeId="7dcef2bd4f0446499074782d1961f589">
<p nodeId="ae20492328e34d6485066e674c05b2fd"><span font-size="14">需要同上游RD沟通，让其发送累计</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="83b7b1a51dff4c4e947131a9717067e4">
<td colwidth="[142]" nodeId="9c6e4bbf05ba4490bb82c75b769e6e6f">
<p nodeId="ec36bcb5631c4d449629a5119dfd5ee2"><km-status pattern="fill" color="#ffe58f" nodeId="3424a3bbaf8f40a58bb16e29d6a8f39b" expand="true"><span font-size="14">​</span><span color="rgb(250, 140, 23)"><span font-size="14">接口调用失败</span></span></km-status></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[590]" nodeId="30d6b6866ace461a89ec2e5fd18e93a3">
<p nodeId="7064c26300ad43fda050a4d64154c75b"><span font-size="14">日志的本条请求中，需要调用外部接口，但接口调用失败，可能为接口不可用、服务异常等</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[466]" nodeId="4dcd86fcb9bb45d9ac1ffe7442dac83e">
<p nodeId="57e8f83f547a48b8bf3b729522f28000"><span font-size="14">同下游RD沟通，让其确认接口可用性</span></p>
</td>
